Selector rules:
- Return rankedNeeds as the useful informationNeeds array sorted from strongest to weakest after considering the player message and availability.
- selectedDataType must be one of the available types when shouldRequestMoreInformation=true.
- Each rankedNeeds subject must remain one of the source categories from the foreground informationNeeds array.
- Do not request deep history just because the word remember appears if a direct answer is already possible.
- Do request deep data when the Star's first reply was a bridge line or the foreground informationNeeds array points to old history, quotes, markers, lore, bestiary, character, world, screen, or story data.
